OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after suspected
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fsuspected shooting in the Cotswolds.
OL,9,FPolice were alerted after a man
OL,10,Fattended hospital with leg injuries
OL,11,Fsuspected to have been caused by a
OL,12,Ffirearm on 15 October. The wounds were
OL,13,Fnot deemed to be life-threatening, and
OL,14,Fhe was later discharged from hospital.
OL,16,FGloucestershire Police said a man has
OL,17,Fsince been arrested in connection with
OL,18,F"a serious incident" near
OL,19,FStow-on-the-Wold, he remains in police
OL,20,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
